---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Shop for Good — Simba & Good" description="Beautifully made digital guides and templates for every stage of your pet's life. Every purchase helps fund animal welfare." path="/shop">
  <header class="page-head"><div class="wrap">
    <img src="/images/shop-for-good-wordmark.svg" alt="Shop for Good — Simba &amp; Good" class="shop-logo" />
    <h1>Little guides for big responsibilities.</h1>
    <p>Practical, beautifully made digital guides and templates for every stage of your pet's life — instant downloads, yours forever.</p>
    <span class="give-strip">🐾 Every purchase helps fund animal welfare.</span>
  </div></header>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Digital guide</span><h3>Puppy's First Year</h3><p>A week-by-week plan for the most important twelve months — vaccines, training windows, nutrition changes, and milestones.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Digital guide</span><h3>Pet Emergency &amp; First-Aid</h3><p>What to do in the moments that matter, before you reach the vet. Clear steps for the situations every owner dreads.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Checklist</span><h3>New Pet Setup Kit</h3><p>Everything to buy, book, and prepare before they come home — so day one is calm instead of chaos.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Digital guide</span><h3>Senior Pet Care</h3><p>Helping older pets stay comfortable and healthy — what changes, what to watch for, and how to make their later years good ones.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Templates</span><h3>Pet Health Records</h3><p>Printable trackers for vaccines, weight, medications, and vet visits — one tidy place for your pet's whole history.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="kind">Digital guide</span><h3>Breed Care Basics</h3><p>Know what your breed actually needs — exercise, grooming, common health risks, and life-stage timing, in plain language.</p><div class="row"><span class="price">$9</span><a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME">Buy</a></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bundle">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Best value</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top:10px">The Whole-Life Bundle</h3>
        <p>All six guides and templates, from first day to senior years. One download, one price — and a bigger contribution to animals in need.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:right">
        <div class="price" style="color:#fff;font-size:30px">$49</div>
        <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/REPLACE_ME" style="margin-top:10px;display:inline-block">Get the bundle</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-head{padding:64px 0 20px}
    .shop-logo{width:340px;max-width:80%;height:auto;display:block;margin-bottom:22px}
    .page-head h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,58px);margin:16px 0 16px}
    .page-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;max-width:52ch}
    .give-strip{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--sage);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 18px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;margin-top:22px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;padding:36px 0 40px}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .card .kind{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
    .card h3{font-size:20px;margin:10px 0 8px;font-weight:500}
    .card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;flex:1}
    .card .row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:20px}
    .price{font-family:"Fraunces",serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600}
    .buy{background:var(--gold);color:var(--forest-deep);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:999px}
    .buy:hover{filter:brightness(1.05)}
    .bundle{background:var(--forest-deep);color:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:34px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:80px}
    .bundle h3{color:#fff;font-size:24px}
    .bundle p{color:#B9C6BC;margin-top:8px;max-width:52ch;font-size:15px}
    .bundle .buy{background:var(--gold)}
    @media (max-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bundle{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</Base>
